<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Daido Concrete shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Daido Concrete shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Daido Concrete (H.K.) Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>On Thursday, shares of concrete piling manufacturer rose HK$0.17 or 20 percent to end at HK$1.02.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
